>      - \( \text{persist}_{\text{delta}} \): Additional impacts from past changes affecting the current period.
> 
> 7. **Calculating GDP from Capital Stock**:
>    - Finally, GDP is derived from the existing capital stock with adjustments for any losses:
>      \[
>      \text{GDP}_t = (1 - \text{fracloss}_{t}) \times \text{GDP}_{\text{baseline}, t}
>      \]
>    - This allows recalibration of GDP estimates based on current capital levels adjusted for potential losses.
